🔍 Blinkit Data Analysis 📊
Welcome to an in-depth data analysis project focused on Blinkit (formerly Grofers) — one of India’s leading instant grocery delivery platforms. This project dives into consumer behavior, product trends, pricing dynamics, and delivery patterns to uncover insights that can drive business decisions.

🚀 Project Objectives
Understand customer ordering patterns and frequency

Analyze product category performance and pricing trends


📈 Key Insights

Which product categories dominate Blinkit orders?

What pricing strategies can be inferred from the dataset?

Consumer behavior trends across weekdays vs weekends

🛠️ Tools & Technologies

Excel

Pivot table

Pivot charts

Slicers

formating

📎 Use Cases

E-commerce performance benchmarking

Last-mile delivery optimization

Data-driven pricing and inventory decisions
